# UI和布局规范

## Element UI组件规范

### 按钮大小规范

项目中使用 `el-button` 组件时，必须遵循以下大小规范：

```vue
<!-- 常规按钮 -->
<el-button type="primary" size="medium">常规按钮</el-button>

<!-- 大号按钮 -->
<el-button type="primary">大号按钮</el-button>

<!-- 小号按钮 -->
<el-button type="primary" size="small">小号按钮</el-button>
```

### 按钮布局规范

#### 左上区域：业务功能按钮

```vue
<div class="left-buttons">
  <el-button type="primary" size="medium" icon="el-icon-plus">新增商品</el-button>
  <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-upload2">导入</el-button>
  <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-download">导出</el-button>
  <el-dropdown>
    <el-button size="medium">
      批量操作<i class="el-icon-arrow-down el-icon--right"></i>
    </el-button>
    <el-dropdown-menu slot="dropdown">
      <el-dropdown-item>批量删除</el-dropdown-item>
      <el-dropdown-item>批量修改</el-dropdown-item>
    </el-dropdown-menu>
  </el-dropdown>
</div>
```

#### 右上区域：搜索和设置

```vue
<div class="right-buttons">
  <el-input placeholder="请输入关键字" size="medium" v-model="searchInput" class="search-input">
    <el-button slot="append" size="medium" icon="el-icon-search"></el-button>
  </el-input>
  <el-button icon="el-icon-refresh" size="medium" circle></el-button>
  <el-button icon="el-icon-setting" size="medium" circle></el-button>
</div>
```

#### 完整布局示例

```vue
<div class="operation-bar">
  <div class="left-buttons">
    <el-button type="primary" size="medium" icon="el-icon-plus">新增商品</el-button>
    <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-upload2">导入</el-button>
    <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-download">导出</el-button>
  </div>
  <div class="right-buttons">
    <el-input placeholder="请输入关键字" size="medium" v-model="searchInput" class="search-input">
      <el-button size="medium" slot="append" icon="el-icon-search"></el-button>
    </el-input>
    <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-refresh" circle></el-button>
    <el-button size="medium" icon="el-icon-setting" circle></el-button>
  </div>
</div>
```

### 主按钮使用规范

- **每个按钮区最多使用一个主按钮（type="primary"）**
- 主按钮用于表示新增、保存、确认等正向操作
- 次要操作使用默认样式或其他类型按钮
- 危险操作使用 `type="danger"` 样式

## 表格组件规范

### 基础表格

```vue
<el-table
  :data="tableData"
  :header-cell-class-name="'festival-theme'"
  border
  fit
  v-loading="loading"
>
  <el-table-column label="序号" type="index" width="60" align="center" />
  <el-table-column prop="name" label="名称" align="center" />
  <el-table-column prop="status" label="状态" align="center">
    <template slot-scope="scope">
      <el-tag :type="scope.row.status === 1 ? 'success' : 'danger'">
        {{ scope.row.status === 1 ? '正常' : '异常' }}
      </el-tag>
    </template>
  </el-table-column>
  <el-table-column label="操作" width="200" align="center">
    <template slot-scope="scope">
      <el-button size="small" @click="handleEdit(scope.row)">编辑</el-button>
      <el-button size="small" type="danger" @click="handleDelete(scope.row)">删除</el-button>
    </template>
  </el-table-column>
</el-table>
```

### 分页组件

```vue
<el-pagination
  :current-page="currentPage"
  :page-size="pageSize"
  :total="total"
  :page-sizes="[10, 20, 50, 100]"
  layout="total, sizes, prev, pager, next, jumper"
  @size-change="handleSizeChange"
  @current-change="handleCurrentChange"
/>
```

## 表单规范

### 基础表单

```vue
<el-form :model="form" :rules="rules" ref="form" label-width="120px">
  <el-form-item label="名称" prop="name">
    <el-input v-model="form.name" placeholder="请输入名称" />
  </el-form-item>
  <el-form-item label="状态" prop="status">
    <el-select v-model="form.status" placeholder="请选择状态">
      <el-option label="启用" value="1" />
      <el-option label="禁用" value="0" />
    </el-select>
  </el-form-item>
  <el-form-item>
    <el-button type="primary" @click="submitForm">提交</el-button>
    <el-button @click="resetForm">重置</el-button>
  </el-form-item>
</el-form>
```

### 表单验证规则

```javascript
data() {
  return {
    form: {
      name: '',
      status: ''
    },
    rules: {
      name: [
        { required: true, message: '请输入名称', trigger: 'blur' },
        { min: 2, max: 50, message: '长度在 2 到 50 个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
      ],
      status: [
        { required: true, message: '请选择状态', trigger: 'change' }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

## 对话框规范

### 基础对话框

```vue
<el-dialog
  :title="dialogTitle"
  :visible.sync="dialogVisible"
  width="600px"
  :before-close="handleClose"
>
  <div class="dialog-content">
    <!-- 对话框内容 -->
  </div>
  <div slot="footer" class="dialog-footer">
    <el-button @click="dialogVisible = false">取消</el-button>
    <el-button type="primary" @click="handleConfirm">确定</el-button>
  </div>
</el-dialog>
```

