## 样式规范

### 全局样式

全局样式定义在 [styles/index.scss](mdc:src/styles/index.scss) 中：

```scss
// 操作按钮区样式
.operation-bar {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 16px;

  .left-buttons .el-button {
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .right-buttons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;

    .search-input {
      margin-right: 8px;
      width: 200px;
    }
  }
}
```

### Element UI样式覆盖

Element UI样式覆盖在 [styles/element-ui.scss](mdc:src/styles/element-ui.scss) 中：

```scss
// 表格头部样式
.el-table .festival-theme {
  background-color: #f5f7fa;
  color: #303133;
}

// 按钮样式调整
.el-button--medium {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
```

## 响应式设计

### 媒体查询

```scss
// 移动端适配
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  .operation-bar {
    flex-direction: column;

    .left-buttons {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .right-buttons {
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
  }
}
```

### 弹性布局

```scss
// 弹性布局
.flex-container {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;

  .flex-item {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
  }
}
```

